				'index.html': `<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #1d2430; background: #fff; }
      main, footer { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem; }
    <\/style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>{{title}}</h1>
      <form id="request" action="/request" method="post">
        <h2>{{mainAction.label}}</h2>
        <p><label for="f-name">Name</label><br><input id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></p>
        <p><label for="f-phone">Phone</label><br><input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required></p>
        <div id="consent">
          <p><label><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required> I agree that {{name}} will process my name and phone number in order to reply to my inquiry. <a href="#privacy">Privacy notice</a></label></p>
          <p><label><input type="checkbox" name="newsletter"> I would like to receive news by email (I can unsubscribe at any time)</label></p>
        </div>
        <p><button type="submit">{{mainAction.label}}</button></p>
      </form>

      <section id="privacy">
        <h2>Privacy notice</h2>
        <section id="p-operator"><h3>1. Controller</h3><p>Controller: {{name}}, {{city}}. To contact us about your data: {{email}}.</p></section>
        <section id="p-data"><h3>2. What data</h3><p>Your name, phone number and the text of the message you type into the form.</p></section>
        <section id="p-purposes"><h3>3. Purposes</h3><p>To reply to your inquiry and prepare a consultation. We use your details for the newsletter only if you separately agree.</p></section>
        <section id="p-basis"><h3>4. Lawful basis</h3><p>To reply to an inquiry: steps you ask us to take before a contract. For the newsletter: your consent, which you give with a separate checkbox.</p></section>
        <section id="p-keep"><h3>5. How long we keep it</h3><p>Three years after your last contact, then we delete the data; the message text is kept for one year.</p></section>
        <section id="p-recipients"><h3>6. Who receives the data</h3><p>Our hosting provider and email service, which process data on our instructions, and our analytics counter (without your name or phone number).</p></section>
        <section id="p-storage"><h3>7. Where it is stored and how it is protected</h3><p>On servers in the EU; your data does not leave the EEA. Protection: HTTPS, password access with two-factor login, regular updates.</p></section>
        <section id="p-rights"><h3>8. Your rights</h3><p>You can ask what data we hold, have it corrected or deleted, and withdraw your consent. Write to {{email}}: we reply within one month. You can complain to your data protection authority (in the UK, the ICO).</p></section>
        <section id="p-cookies"><h3>9. Cookies and counters</h3><p>The site uses an analytics counter; it starts only after you choose to allow it. A detailed list is in the cookie table.</p></section>
        <section id="p-version"><h3>10. Version and changes</h3><p>Version 3, 30 October 2026. Earlier versions are kept. The English text prevails; any other version is a translation.</p></section>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer><p>{{name}} · <a href="#privacy">Privacy notice</a></p></footer>
  </body>
</html>
`
